{"segment_id": "segment_00005", "start": 150.0, "end": 180.0, "speech": "说 What did he say? 他说的是什么？您的回答叫 He said that he was tired. 这是不是很好理解？就是说我五分钟之前说的，肯定是我五分钟之前说，我当他当时很累，对不对啊？那不代表他现在说的这句话。 OK，所以主句是一般过去时，您的时态要有一个后退，把一般现在时变成一般过去时啊，这是一个习惯。", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000015.webp", "time": 156.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["tired", "① I am tired.", " What did he say?", "He said that he was tired."], "scores": [0.99986, 0.91804, 0.98179, 0.97443], "boxes": [[[69.0, 505.0], [236.0, 505.0], [236.0, 581.0], [69.0, 581.0]], [[69.0, 653.0], [382.0, 653.0], [382.0, 714.0], [69.0, 714.0]], [[105.0, 711.0], [540.0, 718.0], [539.0, 781.0], [104.0, 774.0]], [[127.0, 776.0], [722.0, 774.0], [722.0, 837.0], [127.0, 839.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000016.webp", "time": 174.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["tired", "① I am tired.", "What did he say?", "He said that he was tired."], "scores": [0.99991, 0.85013, 0.99036, 0.9657], "boxes": [[[70.0, 505.0], [236.0, 505.0], [236.0, 581.0], [70.0, 581.0]], [[68.0, 651.0], [384.0, 651.0], [384.0, 715.0], [68.0, 715.0]], [[133.0, 705.0], [544.0, 717.0], [542.0, 785.0], [131.0, 773.0]], [[136.0, 777.0], [722.0, 775.0], [722.0, 835.0], [136.0, 837.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000017.webp", "time": 179.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["BLAH BLAE", "BLAH", "interesting"], "scores": [0.84359, 0.8586, 0.9999], "boxes": [[[306.0, 334.0], [429.0, 303.0], [436.0, 329.0], [313.0, 361.0]], [[336.0, 350.0], [398.0, 333.0], [405.0, 358.0], [343.0, 375.0]], [[70.0, 499.0], [429.0, 516.0], [425.0, 598.0], [66.0, 581.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "接下来呢，我们都以相同的方式去练，跟我张嘴读啊。说 The book is interesting. What did she say? She said that the book was interesting. Very good. 那直接英语变间接英语，还有一些其他的时态变化，我们一个一个讲啊。前面是不变的。如果直接英语是现在进行时，am is are加doing，那间接英语就变成过去进行", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000018.webp", "time": 188.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["BLAE BLAET", "BLAE", "interesting", ") The book is interesting.", "What did she say?", "She said that the book was interesting."], "scores": [0.80709, 0.87155, 0.9999, 0.9646, 0.97121, 0.97376], "boxes": [[[304.0, 335.0], [429.0, 302.0], [436.0, 329.0], [311.0, 362.0]], [[336.0, 350.0], [399.0, 333.0], [406.0, 357.0], [343.0, 375.0]], [[69.0, 498.0], [429.0, 514.0], [425.0, 598.0], [65.0, 582.0]], [[108.0, 646.0], [684.0, 658.0], [683.0, 724.0], [107.0, 712.0]], [[132.0, 708.0], [562.0, 717.0], [561.0, 781.0], [131.0, 772.0]], [[128.0, 767.0], [1026.0, 777.0], [1025.0, 846.0], [127.0, 836.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000019.webp", "time": 194.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["直接引语&间接引语"], "scores": [0.99246], "boxes": [[[94.0, 134.0], [539.0, 136.0], [539.0, 197.0], [94.0, 194.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000020.webp", "time": 201.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["直接引语&间接引语", "参考回顾：L99/101", "主句：一般过去时", "直接引|语：现在进行时 am/is/are+doing"], "scores": [0.99221, 0.9993, 0.99902, 0.97316], "boxes": [[[94.0, 134.0], [539.0, 136.0], [539.0, 196.0], [94.0, 193.0]], [[148.0, 283.0], [591.0, 283.0], [591.0, 339.0], [148.0, 339.0]], [[145.0, 345.0], [557.0, 342.0], [557.0, 405.0], [145.0, 407.0]], [[143.0, 400.0], [1055.0, 408.0], [1055.0, 480.0], [143.0, 471.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
